#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = čiste ivice u veličini renderovanja igre. DLSS = isto, i uvećava sliku kad je Skaliranje "
"igre ispod 100 %. Miks = sopstveni TAA igre pomešan sa DLAA / DLSS: mirnije, malo mekše. "
"isključeno = sopstvena slika igre. Čuva se odmah."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Koliko miksa čini TAA igre, 0 - 100 % u koracima od 10 %: više = mirnije i mekše, manje = "
"oštrije. Prikazuje se dok je Režim Miks ili podela ima stranu sa miksom. Bez dodatne cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Podešavanja za vašu grafičku karticu. high = sve uključeno (model 1). medium = model 2, lakša "
"popravka stakala i ograda, ogledala bez praćenja pokretnih delova. low = i bez glatkih ogledala, "
"bez popravke stakala i ograda, VR oblast 60 %. Nikad ne menja podešavanje koje ste sami postavili."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = najviše detalja, najjasniji tekst, oko 1,6 puta više GPU od 2. 2 (E) = balans, najmanje "
"tragova iza saobraćaja: počnite s njom. 3 (F) = najmirnija na ogradama i žicama, može da zamaže "
"pokretne detalje, ista cena kao 2. 4 (M) = najteža (oko 5x), samo za testove u ravnom režimu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kvalitet slike: oštrina, oštrina tekstura, popravka stakala i ograda, popravka svetlosnih tragova "
"i DLAA oblast. Desno otvara grupu, levo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju menija je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Izoštrava sliku posle DLAA, od 0 (isključeno) do 1.0. Povećajte ako je slika mutna; previsoko "
"daje svetle oreole na ivicama. Košta oko 0,1 ms; 0 preskače prolaz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Domet oštrenja, 1 do 4 px: malo = fini detalji, veliko = podebljane ivice. Promenite ako je "
"oštrenje previše fino ili grubo; slika veća od ekrana, kao u VR-u, traži više od 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Jasniji tekst na teksturama (saobraćajni znakovi, tabla, GPS). 0 = isklj.; negativnije = oštrije, "
"ali više treperenja na ogradama; ako je tekst mutan, probajte od -0,5 do -1. Skoro bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Isto za mrežaste ograde, travu i lišće: podignite ka 0 ako ograde trepere, spustite ako trava "
"izgleda mekano. isto = kao red iznad. Radi samo dok Oštrina tekstura nije 0. Skoro bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Žice, ograde i prozori se tretiraju kao predmet napred, a ne kao ono što se vidi kroz njih, pa se "
"ne zamazuju pri kretanju. Isključite ako tamo nema zamazivanja: štedi 0,02 - 0,06 ms po oku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Sprečava sjaj uličnih lampi i farova da ostavlja trag iza sebe pri kretanju: sjaj se crta iznova "
"u svakom kadru, umesto da se meša sa starim kadrovima. Korak 25 %; smanjite ako sjaj lampi "
"treperi, 0 = isklj. Košta oko 0,05 - 0,2 ms po oku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: samo sredina svakog oka dobija DLAA (20 do 100 %); ivica zadržava sliku igre. Smanjite za "
"teži model ili više fps; 40 % košta oko 40 % modela. Određuje i kamion u garaži / glavnom meniju."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kako DLAA obrađuje pokretne delove i retrovizore kamiona. Desno otvara grupu, Levo je zatvara; "
"pri svakom otvaranju menija je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA prati svaki pokretni objekat posebno (saobraćaj, točkove, tablice), pa ostaje jasno i bez "
"tragova. Isključite samo da uštedite oko 0,5 ms po oku ili za test: tada se sve kreće s kamerom, "
"a saobraćaj se zamazuje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Gladi i ogledala kamiona da ne trepere. 1 ogledalo = samo najveće (glavno pored vas). sva = svako "
"ogledalo. kamera = najjeftinije po ogledalu, pokretni saobraćaj može ostaviti tragove u staklu; "
"ostali prate svaki pokretni objekat."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"uklj. = svaki retrovizor dobija DLAA svaki 2. kadar, a između prikazuje poslednju čistu sliku: "
"otprilike pola cene retrovizora. Ivice ostaju čiste; pokretno u staklu osvežava se upola sporije. "
"isklj. = svaki retrovizor svaki kadar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Broj kadrova i CPU: CPU podešavanje, AMD keš jezgra, FPS limit i malo kašnjenje (Reflex) za ravan "
"režim, FPS limit za VR. Desno otvara grupu, levo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju menija je "
"zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tri CPU prekidača zajedno. Preferiraj brza jezgra: samo Intel procesori sa P- i E-jezgrima. Visok "
"prioritet i bez Windows štednje struje za igru: svaki CPU, Intel i AMD. Pomaže kad je CPU "
"ograničenje; bez cene. Posebno u dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"AMD X3D procesori sa dve grupe jezgara (7950X3D, 9950X3D): drži igru na jezgrima sa velikim 3D "
"V-Cache-om, koji igre vole. Menja se odmah; isklj. vraća igri sva jezgra. Probajte i uporedite u "
"gužvi u gradu. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravan režim. Drži igru najviše na ovom broju kadrova: ujednačeno vreme kadra, manje toplote "
"i struje. Postavite malo ispod onoga što vaš računar drži u gužvi u gradu. Kad je malo kašnjenje "
"(Reflex) uključeno, ograničava NVIDIA drajver. isklj. = bez limita."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravan režim, samo NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Uklj. = kadrovi igre čekaju manje pre nego što ih "
"kartica nacrta: manje kašnjenje između volana i slike kad je kartica ograničenje. Boost drži i "
"takt kartice visoko. Isti fps; mala cena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. polovina = igra crta svaki 2. kadar slušalica (72 Hz -> 36 fps), trećina = svaki 3.; "
"glađenje kadrova slušalica (ASW / Motion Smoothing) popunjava ostalo ujednačenim ritmom. "
"Koristite kad fps skače. Dok je uključeno, Turbo je isključen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"VR ubrzanja: Turbo, foveated renderovanje, preskakanje skrivenih ivica sočiva i da li su "
"pronađeni OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Desno otvara grupu, levo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju "
"menija je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo isključuje glađenje kadrova slušalica (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Samo VR. Uklj. = igra "
"ne čeka slušalice svaki kadar: više fps samo kad je CPU ograničenje (gužva u gradu, saobraćaj). "
"Isključite ako slika trza."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Oštar centar, manje detalja na ivicama (samo NVIDIA RTX). Štedi GPU vreme pri visokom Scaling-u. "
"Samo VR. Spoljni prsten dobija jednu boju na 2 x 2 piksela; ograde, trava i lišće zadržavaju pun "
"detalj. Isključite ako ivica izgleda kockasto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Koliko je velik oštar centar Foveated renderovanja, 10 - 100 % u koracima od 5 %: veći = veći deo "
"pogleda oštar, manja ušteda; manji = veća ušteda, manje detalja počinje bliže sredini. "
"Podrazumevano 80 % (balans); 90 = širok, 65 = uzak."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Šta Foveated renderovanje čini grubljim. scena = samo 3D svet (podrazumevano). scena + "
"osvetljenje = i osvetljenje igre, samo na samoj ivici: veća ušteda. Testirajte: tražite kockaste "
"ivice svetla ili senki sa strane pogleda."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Koliko je grub spoljni prsten Foveated renderovanja. Normalno = 1 boja na 2 x 2 piksela "
"(podrazumevano). Jako = na 4 x 2, Maks = na 4 x 4: veća GPU ušteda, kockaste ivice. Najbolje uz "
"praćenje očiju, gde nikad ne gledate u spoljni prsten."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentalno. Oštar centar Foveated renderovanja prati vaše oči na slušalicama s praćenjem "
"očiju (npr. Varjo); bez toga centar ostaje na sredini sočiva. Foveated renderovanje mora biti "
"uključeno pri pokretanju igre, inače treba restart. Skoro bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Igra preskače uglove sočiva koje nikad ne vidite (VR naočare ih javljaju), pa crta manje "
"piksela: više GPU rezerve, slika ostaje ista. Prvo uključivanje traži restart igre. Isključite "
"ako ivica pogleda izgleda pogrešno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR generisanje kadrova od djules75, zasebno preuzimanje "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). pronađen = njegov sloj je učitan u ovoj igri i mod propušta "
"njegov rad. Pokrenite njegovu tray aplikaciju pre igre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR paket poboljšanja od DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, Depth, "
"generisanje kadrova; pronađen = njegov sloj je učitan u igri i mod propušta njegov rad. Pokrenite "
"samo jedan Turbo (njegov ili moda)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Gde lebdi sopstveni VR interfejs igre (HUD, meniji). Mod upisuje promenu u konzolu igre umesto "
"vas; potrebni su g_developer i g_console 1 u config.cfg. Desno otvara grupu, Levo je zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Koji od rasporeda VR interfejsa igre pomeraju redovi ispod: vožnja (HUD tokom vožnje) ili meniji "
"(ekrani menija igre)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Pomera VR interfejs igre: visinu, stranu, udaljenost, nagib, okret, veličinu ili zakrivljenost, "
"malim koracima. Igra dobija svaku promenu oko 0,4 s posle vašeg poslednjeg pritiska: konzola se "
"sama otvara i zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Desno: sve vrednosti oba rasporeda vraćaju se na ono što je config.cfg imao na početku (igra čuva "
"sopstvene vrednosti pri izlasku)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Mala kutija uživo s fps i vremenom kadra, i kad je meni zatvoren (ravan režim i VR): fps, ms, "
"samo brojevi, svaki sa ili bez grafikona nedavnih vremena kadrova (skokovi su crveni), ili samo "
"grafikon. Njena GPU cena je izmerena. Sačuvaj je pamti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zaključavanje, položaj, veličina, boja, VR udaljenost i okretanje FPS okvira. Desno otvara grupu, "
"Levo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju menija je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomera FPS okvir u stranu, u % ekrana (VR fixed / attached: stepeni oko vas). Ravno i VR pamte "
"svaki svoj položaj. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomera FPS okvir gore / dole, u % ekrana (VR fixed / attached: stepeni, minus = gore). Ravno i VR "
"pamte svaki svoj položaj. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Povećava ili smanjuje FPS okvir (0,2 .. 3,0). Povećajte ako ga ne možete čitati u VR naočarima "
"ili na velikom ekranu. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Boja teksta FPS okvira: 20 boja, svaka s obrubom da se čita na svakoj slici (crno na belom = "
"tamni tekst, beli obrub). Ravno i VR. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Svetlina FPS okvira, 10 - 100 %: 100 = boja kakva jeste, niže zatamnjuje tekst (obrub ostaje) "
"prema crnoj. Koristite za utišavanje brojača noću ili u VR naočarima. Ravno i VR. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Providnost celog FPS okvira, 10 - 100 %: 100 = puno, niže bledi tekst I crni obrub zajedno, pa "
"zatamnjeni okvir ne postaje crna mrlja. Ravno i VR. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Koliko unazad pokazuje grafikon fps: 2 - 60 s. Jedan stubić po delu vremena = njegov najsporiji "
"kadar, pa se vide skokovi. Zeleno = na vreme, žuto = malo sporo, crveno = zasek; linija = "
"učestanost slušalica / FPS limit / vaš uobičajeni nivo. Prikazuje se kad FPS brojač ima grafikon."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Prati glavu = kreće se sa slušalicama. Fiksirano u prostoru = jedno mesto oko vašeg "
"sedišta, ne njiše se s kabinom. Na vozilu = zalepljeno za kabinu, njiše se s njom (treba DLAA + "
"praćenje pokretnih delova). Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, Zalepljeno na vozilo. Uklj. = svaki kamion / auto pamti svoje mesto FPS okvira u kabini, "
"okretanje, veličinu, boju, svetlinu i tekst (čuva se u dlaa.ini pri zatvaranju menija). Isklj. = "
"jedan zajednički skup za sva vozila. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, Zalepljeno na vozilo. Desno = ponovo izmeri kabinu sada (mirno sedite, parkirano) ako "
"okvir ne stoji dobro. Levo = okvir ovog vozila na podrazumevano (mesto, okretanje, veličina, "
"boja, tekst); druga vozila zadržavaju svoje. Okvir je pravougaon na kabinu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Okreće FPS okvir ulevo / udesno oko sebe, u stepenima (+ = lice se "
"okreće udesno). Koristite za nagib okvira kad je sa strane. 0 = gleda ka vama. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Naginje FPS okvir, u stepenima (+ = gornja ivica se naginje od vas, "
"kao da leži na instrument tabli). 0 = gleda ka vama. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Rotira FPS okvir u njegovoj ravni, u stepenima (+ = u smeru kazaljke). "
"0 = uspravno. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Koliko daleko FPS okvir lebdi, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Zadržava istu veličinu u "
"vašem pogledu na svakoj udaljenosti; menja se samo dubina. Stavite ga blizu dubine na koju "
"gledate da ga čitate bez ponovnog fokusiranja. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Položaj, veličina, dubina i okrenutost panela te tasteri menija. Desno otvara grupu, Levo je "
"zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju menija je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomera panel u stranu, u % ekrana (VR fixed in cab: stepeni oko sedišta). Ravno i VR pamte svaki "
"svoj položaj. Koristite ako panel zaklanja nešto važno. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomera panel gore / dole, u % ekrana (VR fixed in cab: stepeni, plus = dole). Ravno i VR pamte "
"svaki svoj položaj. Koristite ako panel zaklanja nešto važno. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Povećava ili smanjuje panel. Povećajte ako ga ne možete čitati, smanjite ako zaklanja previše. "
"Ravno i VR pamte svaki svoju veličinu. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Prati glavu = panel se kreće sa VR naočarima. Fiksno u kabini = ostaje na jednom mestu "
"ispred sedišta, miran dok gledate unaokolo; X / Y / depth tada određuju to mesto (stepeni, "
"metri). Traži VR sloj (podrazumevano). Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Koliko daleko panel lebdi: u metrima (0,30 - 3,00) kao VR sloj, "
"podrazumevano; u px pomaka ka unutra po oku uz menu_vr_layer = 0. Ista veličina na svakoj dubini. "
"Promenite ako je gledanje panela zamorno. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Uklj. = panel se okreće ka vama kad ga pomerite u stranu, ista "
"veličina iz svakog ugla (kao VR sloj, podrazumevano, i FPS okvir koji prati glavu); isklj. = "
"ravna slika. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Prekidači za poređenje: DLAA isklj., sopstveni TAA igre pomešan ili rame uz rame, popravke žica, "
"DLAA ranije. Za normalnu vožnju ništa od ovoga nije potrebno. Desno otvara grupu, levo je zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje ili isključuje ceo mod i pamti režim; isklj. prikazuje izvornu sliku igre, za "
"poređenje. Isključeno štedi cenu svih delova zajedno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"uključeno = mod levo, sopstveni TAA igre desno, za poređenje (Položaj linije podele, Podela: levo "
"| desno). Zamenjuje Miks dok je uključeno. Kad je konzola igre uključena, mod umesto vas menja "
"uglačavanje ivica igre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Gde je linija podele, 0 - 100 % širine u koracima od 5 %: levo od nje DLAA / DLSS moda, desno TAA "
"igre. Koristi se samo dok je Podela sa TAA igre uključena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Šta podela prikazuje na svoje dve strane: DLAA | TAA (mod levo, TAA igre desno), miks | TAA ili "
"DLAA | miks (miks = to dvoje pomešano prema Količini miksa). DLSS umesto DLAA pri uvećavanju. "
"Koristi se samo dok je Podela sa TAA igre uključena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice se pravilno kreću tokom vožnje: njihovo kretanje je raspoređeno po celoj tankoj "
"liniji. uklj. = podrazumevano. isklj. = samo za poređenje; bliske žice više trepere. Slika je "
"kratko mekana pri prebacivanju."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice se računaju kao napred na svakom pikselu koji dodiruju, čak i kad pokrivaju samo mali "
"deo. uklj. = podrazumevano. uklj. (bez A2C) = i za providne ivice kao lišće. isklj. = samo za "
"poređenje; bliske žice više trepere."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentalno: crta daleke žice tanje od 1 piksela kao liniju od 1 piksela, da se ne raspadaju "
"u crtice. Podrazumevano isključeno: daleke žice mogu izgledati tamnije ili jače treperiti. "
"Isprobajte i uporedite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravan režim: DLAA radi pre nego što igra doda sjaj i boje, pa oznake na putu, žice i šine "
"manje trepere. Menjajte samo radi poređenja. Ne koristi se sa DLSS uvećanjem i Windows HDR. Ista "
"cena; prebacivanje traje oko sekundu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Izveštaj o grešci: dvaput pritisnite taster za snimanje (ili Snimi sada) gde nešto izgleda "
"pogrešno; mod piše jedan zip koji prilažete GitHub issue-u. Desno otvara grupu, levo je zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Jedan prekidač za najpotpuniji izveštaj: detaljnost dnevnika debug, premotavanje 2 s, snimanje "
"Potpuno. Isklj. vraća redove kako su bili. Čuva se samo ovaj prekidač; nametnute vrednosti se "
"nikad ne pišu u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Šta ulazi u dlaa_inject.log: isklj. = ništa; greške = samo otkazivanja (podrazumevano); "
"upozorenja = + zaobiđeni problemi; info = + pokretanje i promene; debag = + statistika i merenja "
"vremena (malo sporije)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Stalno drži poslednjih 0,5 - 3 s kadrova na grafičkoj kartici, pa izveštaj pokazuje trenutak PRE "
"tastera (+ šta je DLSS dobio za poslednje kadrove). Košta video memoriju (MB u koloni cene) i "
"kopiju slike po kadru. isklj. = nema."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Brzo = podaci o sistemu, dnevnici, podešavanja, vaša slika i DLAA isklj. nekoliko kadrova (oko 1 "
"s). Potpuno = + šta je DLSS dobio po kadru (boja, kretanje, dubina) i A/B skupovi: prikaz "
"kretanja, kretanje isklj., samo džiter (oko 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Taster za snimanje. Pritisnite ga DVAPUT u roku od 1 s tokom vožnje gde nešto krene naopako (prvi "
"pritisak ga samo priprema: jedan kratak zvuk). Desno otvara stranicu sa prečicama na njegovom "
"redu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Koliko snimaka ostaje u fascikli dlaa_selftest pored DLL-a: stariji (fascikla + zip) se brišu kad "
"se piše novi. svi = nikad ne briše."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jezik ovog menija. auto = jezik igre (podrazumevano); Levo / Desno bira drugi. Linux / Proton: "
"kineski, japanski i korejski traže instalirane fontove, vidi README. Datoteka lang\\<code>.po uz "
"DLL ima prednost, za vaše ispravke. Sačuvaj u dlaa.ini ga pamti. Bez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Svi tasteri ovog menija, jedan red po radnji, sa tasterom na tastaturi i dugmetom kontrolera. "
"Desno otvara listu; izaberite radnju sa Desno, zatim pritisnite novi taster ili dugme na volanu. "
"Odmah se čuva u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
