#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = snimi sada (meni se prvo zatvara). Zip (fascikla dlaa_selftest pored DLL-a) sadrži podatke "
"o sistemu, dnevnik moda i igre, dlaa.ini, vašu sliku i DLAA isklj.; Potpuno dodaje šta je DLSS "
"dobio i A/B skupove; premotavanje dodaje trenutak pre. Vaše korisničko ime i početna fascikla se "
"uklanjaju. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"5 tastera koji otvaraju i upravljaju ovim menijem: %hs otvara / zatvara (vrednost), %hs / %hs / "
"%hs / %hs pomeraju (kolona Taster). Dok je meni otvoren, igri se uskraćuje samo ovih 5. %hs: "
"menjajte ih na stranici Prečice."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Zatvara meni; 5 tastera menija vraća se igri. %hs radi isto iz bilo kog reda."

